stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BuildManifest
    BuildManifest --> Pending: sealed manifest has cold assets
    BuildManifest --> Ready: sealed manifest is empty or already resident
    Pending --> Pending: Preparing / CpuReady / UploadQueued
    Pending --> Ready: every required asset is Resident
    Pending --> Failed: any required asset fails
    Pending --> Canceled: map session loses focus or unloads
    Failed --> ReleaseLeases: release resident and in-flight map requests
    Canceled --> ReleaseLeases: release exact session leases
    Ready --> Playable: fire MapLoaded / MapResumed
    ReleaseLeases --> [*]
    Playable --> [*]
